+    fix(df-0924-05): UI dead on hardened auth deployments — token entry, boot namespace adoption, retry storm kill
+    
+    Three measured root causes, all fixed in packages/ui (sources only; .js
+    artifacts are gitignored):
+    
+    1. Zero credentials: apiFetch never sent X-API-Key and the UI had no token
+       entry anywhere. Now: getApiToken/setApiToken/clearApiToken persist to
+       localStorage key duckbrain-api-token; apiFetch attaches X-API-Key on
+       every request when set (omitted when unset); ApiAuthError (401-class)
+       vs ApiError (status attached) split; ApiTokenControl in the header
+       (masked input, Save/Clear, "Token set" indicator) and ApiAuthBanner
+       ("Not authorized - enter your DuckBrain API token") rendered when the
+       boot fetch 401s.
+    
+    2. Hardcoded namespace: ui-store seeded currentNamespace='default' and
+       nothing ever read the server value. Now: useNamespaceBoot() fetches
+       GET /api/namespaces once on mount and adopts the server-reported
+       currentNamespace (server wins over the hardcoded fallback and any
+       persisted value; 'default' remains only as the fetch-failure fallback).
+       Live-verified: UI booted on an --auth=apikey scratch daemon and adopted
+       the server's currentNamespace.
+    
+    3. Retry storm: both QueryClients used TanStack's default retry(3) on
+       everything. Now shouldRetryQuery(): auth errors never retried, other
+       errors at most once. Live-verified: 401 boot produced 2 namespaces
+       calls (no amplification), no 429s.
+    
+    Live E2E on a real --auth=apikey daemon (:3795) via vite dev server:
+    no-token boot showed the banner + token input (not skeletons), saving the
+    token through the UI cleared the banner, panels rendered real data
+    (Active Memories 2, timeline rows authored df0924-05@duckbrain.local),
+    zero errors, zero 429s.
+    
+    Gates: packages/ui build OK, 9 files / 54 tests (38 existing + 16 new);
+    root suite 167 files / 1332 tests; tsc --noEmit clean; prettier clean on
+    all touched files (5 pre-existing ui drift files untouched, documented).
+    
+    Judge: DF-0924-05 (this commit).
+    
